Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.36,0:00:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们能赶过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So thanks for coming by, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.99,0:00:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们希望你们能帮我们  想一些婚礼上用的点子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We wanted to bounce some ideas off of you about the wedding ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:08.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  你还好吗  好啊  只是因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the matter? Are you okay? Yeah, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.25,0:00:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡说了“婚礼”\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica said "wedding."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:18.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们希望你们之中  有人能上台念些感性的文章\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, so we wanted to know if one of you would like to read something during the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:22.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我想我应该也能胜任\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, yeah, I guess, I guess I can do that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也能胜任\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.05,0:00:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我自己想了一个点子  来庆祝你们的婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I kind of, ahem, have something else planned for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能告诉我们是什么点子吗   抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you mind telling us what it is? Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想把它当成最高机密\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm kind of keeping this one on the QT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.23,0:00:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管你是指哪个  我希望会有眨眼睛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, whatever it is, I hope it involves winking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.36,0:00:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟《我日》的编剧谈过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I just talked to one of the DOOL writers today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么是《我日》 《我们的日子》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is DOOL? Days Of Our Lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们一定不相信  我演的角色就要醒过来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, you're not gonna believe it. My character is coming out of his coma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.41,0:00:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那真的是太棒了  哇  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's wonderful. Wow, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不只是那个  我会有个新脑子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And not only that. I'm getting a new brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的工作跟私生活  进步都好大啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So great things are happening at work and in your personal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:07.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要换个新脑子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean you're getting a new brain?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.51,0:01:10.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要踢走剧中一个角色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're killing off one of the characters, and when she dies...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将她的脑子移植到我的身体里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and her brain is being transplanted into my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.97,0:01:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  脑部移植手术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh, what? A brain transplant?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.94,0:01:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这太可笑了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.73,0:01:24.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可笑的是你三个半月没有做过爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think it's ridiculous that you haven't had sex in three and a half months.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.70,0:01:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是冬天  街上的人少了很多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's winter. There are fewer people on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.87,0:01:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要踢走谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who are they killing off?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.37,0:01:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,西西雅梦露  她饰演洁西卡拉哈特\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Cecilia Monroe. She plays Jessica Lockhart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.12,0:01:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.29,0:01:43.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她最擅长将饮料泼到别人的脸上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She is so good at throwing drinks in people's faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没看过她喝完一杯饮料\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think I've ever seen her finish a beverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.05,0:01:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有她打人巴掌的样子  你不想那么做吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The way she slaps people. Wouldn't you love to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.88,0:01:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.18,0:01:54.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她参与这出戏的演出很久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And she's been on the show forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.22,0:01:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要代替她一定很难  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's gonna be really hard to fill her shoes. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你得帮帮我  当你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Help me out here. When you--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.81,0:02:03.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你做过脑部移植手术后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When you come out of the "brain transplant"...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.48,0:02:06.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要变成她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you are going to be her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  她被困在德瑞克的身体里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, but in Drake Ramoray's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:15.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么就是搞不懂  我还以为你是科学家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why is this so hard for you to get? I thought you were a scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.25,0:02:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第七季  第15集  乔伊换脑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S07E15  The One With Joey's New Brain
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:25.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.59,0:02:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.89,0:02:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  那边那个男的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rash, so that guy there:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.83,0:02:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是异性恋还是同性恋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Straight or gay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他太帅了  不可能是异性恋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah, he's too cute to be straight. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.21,0:03:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大波霸小姐会帮我们查个清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, Knockers will help us figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.01,0:03:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  他是异性恋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且一眼就看得出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And not subtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他忘了拿手机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He left his cell phone. Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.68,0:03:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把它交给阿甘  放在失物招领处\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well, We could hand it to Gunther, he'll put it in lost and found.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或是用它打电话到中国  看看那些人在做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or we could use it to call China, see how those guys are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他打电话来找手机  我接了电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What if, uh, he calls his own cell phone to find out who found it, and I answer...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.03,0:03:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们开始聊天  之后坠入爱河呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and we start talking and we fell in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.87,0:03:38.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那到是个很棒的故事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean wouldn't that be a great story?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.28,0:03:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像是数码时代的童话故事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Kind of like a fairy tale for the digital age. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来真棒  我要去拿手机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That does sound great. I'm gonna get the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.33,0:03:47.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  等一下  为什么你会成为故事的女主角\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Wait. Why do you get the story?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我已经很久没有约会了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. I haven't been out on a date in so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  三天前你才约过会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, you had a date three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.51,0:03:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是约会  那只是  朋友聚会  然后做爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That wasn't a date. That was, That was just friends getting together and having sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.35,0:04:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这样  我去拿手机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Great. See, I get the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  不行  一星期前你才跟泰格分手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No way! No way! You just broke up with Tag a week ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  直到现在  我才明白  我能再爱一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, and until now, I didn't think I would love again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说的好  等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice try. Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么公平地决定  谁能拿走手机呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do we fairly decide who gets the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.20,0:04:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe we could, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:30.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你动作太慢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah-ha! Too slow! Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你太自信了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah-ha! Too cocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（银杯片厂）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.14,0:04:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在跟他约会  你管不了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going to keep dating him Mother, and there's nothing you can do about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我管得了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.01,0:04:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你打算怎么做  杀了他吗  就像你杀了查尔斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you going to do? Kill him? Like you did with Charles?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.23,0:04:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的宝贝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.49,0:04:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你演得太好了  刚刚那一巴掌  很逼真  你怎么办到的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was a great scene. And that slap looked so real. How do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.87,0:05:08.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只是多年的经验而已  快给我拿些冰块过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, just years of experience. Can I get some ice here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.25,0:05:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想说  我觉得你的演技很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, I just wanted to say how wonderful I think you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.42,0:05:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是  那个快死掉的影迷吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not the fan who's dying, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我是乔伊崔比亚尼   昨天我们合拍过一场戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, uh, I'm Joey Tribbiani. We did a scene together yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:23.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是那个昏迷的人  那是真人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm the guy in the coma. Oh, that was a real person?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.23,0:05:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你离开后我要移植你的脑子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}An-an-anyway I-I just wanted to say, since I'm getting your brain when you leave the show...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:33.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想如果  我要离开剧组\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I was wondering if there was any tips you can give me... I'm leaving the show?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.65,0:05:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  为什么  你听到什么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know, why? Did you hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.61,0:05:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁告诉你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who told you that? Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,编剧之一  哪个编剧  是秃头佬还是高个子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh uh, One of the writers. Which one? Was it bald or was it tall?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.58,0:05:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个不重要   因为那不是真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, it doesn't matter, because it is not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.91,0:05:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Whoo, eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:52.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果那是真的  你竟然敢来叫我教你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if it were true, how dare you come to me and ask me for tips...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.17,0:05:57.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该如何饰演我演了二十年的角色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...about a character I've been playing for 20 years! I'll give you a tip!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梦露小姐  好吧  你干的不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Miss Monroe-Oh, there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.31,0:06:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  听着  我有个点子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, look, I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.85,0:06:13.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么不看看  他的快速拨键记录了哪些电话号码呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't we, Why don't we see what kind of numbers he has on his speed dial'?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.82,0:06:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟他有最多共通点的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then from that, we can tell who has more in common with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.03,0:06:18.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就可以把手机拿走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and whoever does gets the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.61,0:06:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行  好吧  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,速拨键的第一个名字是 "妈妈"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}First name on the speed dial is "Mom." Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我妈妈自杀死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I lost my mom to suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.41,0:06:33.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能利用那一点  抢走帅哥跟最后一块蓝莓松饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't use that to get the cute guy and the last muffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我已经用过那个借口了  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did I use that already today? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班  卡洛斯  大卫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Ben, Carlos, David--"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.93,0:06:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我赢了  他在速拨键里记下了巴尼斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I win. He's got Barney's on his speed dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.10,0:06:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道  他指的是不是巴尼斯服饰店\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So? You don't know that it's Barney's the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:49.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那可能是他朋友家或是酒吧的电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That could be y'know his friend's house, or a bar, or--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.73,0:06:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁会把巴尼斯服饰店的电话  记录成快速拨键呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who has Barney's the store on their speed dial?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的新女朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}His new girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.70,0:07:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么声音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想是快死掉的猫在举行游行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think it's the Dying Cat Parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来是从对街传来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sounds like it's coming from across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.09,0:07:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得罗斯说过  他要在婚礼上给我们惊喜吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know that thing that Ross was gonna do at our wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我出去混时说  "你有苏格兰的血统吧"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He was hanging out with me yesterday and he turned to me and said, "You're half Scottish, right?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.60,0:07:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不可能  不可能是罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. There is no way. It cannot be Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可思议  为什么你有苏格兰血统\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unbelievable. Why is your family Scottish?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.91,0:07:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么罗斯是你哥哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why is your family Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.20,0:07:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不能在婚礼上演奏  大家都会跑光的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He cannot play at our wedding. I mean everyone will leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.50,0:07:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  那只是噪音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, come on. That is just noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那根本不算是歌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not even a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.04,0:08:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  如果你仔细听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait. If you listen very carefully, I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想它是库尔  与伙伴合唱团唱的《庆祝》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it's "Celebration" by Kool and the Gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.31,0:08:13.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对  他们是要将我踢出这出戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're absolutely right. They are writing me out of the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们还没有决定  什么时候  但应该很快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They don't know exactly when it's going to happen, but apparently it's soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and then that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.07,0:08:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉  如果我可以决定  你永远都不会离开这出戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. If it was up to me, you would never leave the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  我是认真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, thanks. No, I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信他们会对你这么做  还有你的影迷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe they'd do this to you. And to your fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.07,0:08:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们一定会崩溃伤心  他们是那么地爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're gonna be devastated. Heartbroken. They love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.08,0:08:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你叫什么名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's your name again? Uh
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.04,0:08:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey. Joey. Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.05,0:08:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的太贴心了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is so sweet. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.84,0:08:47.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  之前我来找你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The-The only reason that I, that I came up to you before...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.43,0:08:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...was because, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.55,0:08:52.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为要饰演你我真的很紧张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because I'm really nervous about being you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你帮我抓住角色的精髓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, if you could help me capture the essence of the character.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.81,0:08:59.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助我让洁西卡  继续活下去  可以吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know? Help me keep Jessica alive. Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  乔伊  我会帮你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, Joey, I will help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是因为我对这出蠢戏有亏欠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not because I owe it to this stupid show...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是因为我亏欠洁西卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but because I owe it to Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的是太棒了  谢谢你  别客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's great. Thank you so much. You're so welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在观摩录影带  你觉得这招如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been watching some tapes. How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.71,0:09:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洁西卡拉哈特  永远都不会再踏入这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jessica Lockhart will never step foot in this place again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永远都不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:28.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但洁西卡没有英国腔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, but, Jessica doesn't have an English accent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.97,0:09:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有英国腔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can do an English accent?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把这点写在我的履历表里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That baby's going on my resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.69,0:09:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  你好吗   我很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Pheebs. How are you? Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.90,0:09:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得我们在咖啡厅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, Phoebe, remember when we were in the coffeehouse...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.82,0:09:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们决定我可以  拿走那个帅哥的手机吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we decided I was gonna keep the cute guy's phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.11,0:09:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记得啊  我把它放在我的皮包里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. And remember how I said I was gonna keep it in my purse...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果它响了  我就能立刻接听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so that if it rang, I could just pick it up? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得你从我的皮包  把手机偷走了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then do you remember going into my purse and stealing the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.67,0:10:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听不懂你在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, now you lost me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.21,0:10:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你偷走了手机  不  我没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You stole the phone. No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  如果我拨号过去  它会不会响呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No? So you're saying that if I called it, it wouldn't ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.05,0:10:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Hmm. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.38,0:10:12.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然你要拨号了  我要让你看看  我刚买的响铃皮包\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Umm, okay. But while you dial, let me show you the features of my new ringing handbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  它真的响了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it does work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  那是另一只手机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe. That is a different phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.31,0:10:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  喂  对  你好  瑞秋在吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, is it? Hello. Yes, hi. ls Rachel there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.15,0:10:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在  请稍等  是找我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, she is. Just one moment, please. It's for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是铁证\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is damning evidence. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.53,0:10:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  我敢说是他打来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. I bet that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.91,0:10:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的数码童话故事就要开始了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My digital fairy tale's about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's ri--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能不能别再那么做了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you stop doing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  对  我就是捡到你手机的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello? Yes, I'm the one who found your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.55,0:10:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你不能  我在打电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, you can't do th-Shh, I'm on a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.39,0:10:57.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  今晚你能过来拿  就八点半吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, yeah, I mean, you could pick it up tonight. Say, 8:30?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:11:00.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到我家来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}At my apartment. It's, um--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.48,0:11:04.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩顿街五号  十四号房\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's, um, 5 Morton Street, apartment 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.19,0:11:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许之后我们可以去吃点东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then maybe, you know, after, we could grab a bite to eat or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.61,0:11:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  到时候见  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Okay, I'll see you then. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他来的时候我会在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You do know that I will be here when he comes over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.28,0:11:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道他什么时候会来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, and how will you know what time to come over?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.70,0:11:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚说出来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You just said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.63,0:11:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个角色的精髓源自于她的自信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, the essence of the character is rooted in her confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,譬如说  当洁西卡走进一个房间时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So when Jessica enters a room, for instance...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.56,0:11:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她拥有那个房间里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...she owns everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有事物跟所有人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and every person in that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来试试看  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You try it. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.99,0:11:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没有对这个房间生气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. Well, he's not mad at the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.37,0:12:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再试一次  他拥有它  他拥有这个房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Try it again. He owns it. He owns the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是他的  他拥有  这个房间  他拥有它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It is his. He owns, owns, owns the room! He owns it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.00,0:12:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这看着有点奇怪   但已经好多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a little weird, but it's getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:15.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会很想念这个女人  我不知道我该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'm gonna miss this woman so much. I don't know what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.51,0:12:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我演这出戏二十年了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's been 20 years of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:22.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这是件好事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey. Maybe-Maybe, uh-Maybe this is a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它给你机会做改变   扮演不一样的角色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know? It'll give you a chance to shake things up. Play different characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.40,0:12:27.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你才华洋溢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're so talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.06,0:12:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我该在几年前离开   那时很多人找我接戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Probably should've just left years ago when the offers were pouring in...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我在这里过得太舒服了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but, you know, I just got so comfy here and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我错失了很多大好的机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh, I turned down some amazing work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.91,0:12:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,譬如说呢  喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like what? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:43.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就说如果我在十五年前离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...let's just say if I'd left 15 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在的墨西哥影坛会完全不一样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the landscape of Mexican cinema would be very different today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.84,0:12:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.96,0:12:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在现在时机不一样了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, well, now... Now's a different time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.85,0:13:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  别这样  别这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, come on. Don't, uh-Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.10,0:13:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说句话  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me tell you something, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我看到你演戏时  我想 "天啊  她是个很棒的演员"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now when I watch you do a scene, I'm thinking, "Boy, she is a great actress."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.32,0:13:16.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我也会想 "她好辣"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But-But I'm also thinking, "She is hot."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.37,0:13:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我很辣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You think I'm hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.79,0:13:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拥有这个房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You own the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我们应该\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We-We should probably get the...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.29,0:13:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们应该\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. Yeah, we should get--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.84,0:13:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当洁西卡吻男人时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So when Jessica kisses a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她通常会把\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...she usually puts, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.52,0:13:48.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,双手放在那个男人脸上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...both her hands on the man's face.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.89,0:13:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我注意到了  那是因为她充满了热情吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I notice that. Is that because she's so passionate?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.65,0:13:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那是因为  那样子摄影机只能拍到她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's because that way the camera only sees her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:00.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想试试看吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.34,0:14:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  真的很不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was good. That was really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.63,0:14:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我想你手的位置不对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I think that maybe your hands are just a little off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.22,0:14:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们应该  像这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They should be, maybe-Like, right-Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.69,0:14:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想吃一些点心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I feel like a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.11,0:14:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要吃点脆饼吗  它可是你故乡苏格兰的点心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you want some shortbread? It's Scottish, like you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.24,0:14:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  谢谢  我不喜欢苏格兰的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, thanks. I don't like anything from my Scottish heritage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.62,0:14:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.79,0:14:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我的家族被赶出苏格兰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it's just that my entire family was run out of Scotland by...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是维京人干的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Vikings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.42,0:14:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来你家人  准备要恢复苏格兰传统\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh well, it sounds to me like your family's ready to, uh, rediscover its Scottish roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.47,0:15:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能在婚礼上吹风笛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't play bagpipes at the wedding!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:04.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们听到你在家里吹风笛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We heard you play all the way from your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你们去报警的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Were you the ones who called the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在那个真的不重要了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not really important right now. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.56,0:15:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重要的是  我们谢谢你的好意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is important is, while we appreciate the gesture...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:21.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是觉得  我们的婚礼上不适合吹风笛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we just don't feel that bagpipes are appropriate for our wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么   因为我们讨厌风笛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why not? Because we hate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.53,0:15:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我机会为你们表演  再做最后的决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just give me a chance to perform for you, and then decide whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也不会告诉你们  我要吹哪首曲子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not gonna tell you what song I'm gonna play, either. But, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.29,0:15:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就说当表演结束后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...let's just say when it's over...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.33,0:15:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定会庆祝一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'll bet there'll be a wee bit 0' celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.30,0:15:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.77,0:15:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是汤姆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, It's Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来拿手机的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm hereto pick up the phone. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.19,0:15:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要你去开门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, why do you get to answer the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.73,0:16:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不行   因为这里是我家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why shouldn't I? Because it's my apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.74,0:16:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么由我来把手机交给他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, then I get to give him the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.11,0:16:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  希望你能好好  跟他解释那些打到中国的电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Good luck explaining all the calls to China.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.49,0:16:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们争执了多久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, how long were we arguing for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.76,0:16:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是那个忘了拿手机的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not the man who left the cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.18,0:16:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  他是我的助理  他会来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that's my assistant. Is he coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.47,0:16:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能让我们谈一下吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Could you, uh, give us one second?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题  我们马上回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. We'll be right back, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该怎么办   我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what do we do? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:42.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能相信吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you believe this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.86,0:16:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在等一个帅哥  结果来了一个超级大帅哥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were waiting for a hot guy and an even hotter one shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.28,0:16:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.62,0:16:53.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.25,0:16:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  听我说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你能把他让给我  我真的欠你一个大人情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...if you let me have him, then I will really owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.38,0:17:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  菲比  我把他让给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, All right Phoebe, I will let you have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你欠我一个大人情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you owe me. You owe me big.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.01,0:17:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪一位漂亮的小姐要陪我去吃晚餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So which one of you lovely ladies am I gonna take to dinner, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.72,0:17:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that'd be me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:18.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你先走  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}After you. Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.69,0:17:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.57,0:17:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的确拥有那个房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you certainly own that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.03,0:17:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我租下了整间公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, I rent the whole place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.79,0:17:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚了解你的意思了  谢谢夸奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I just got what you meant. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.29,0:17:40.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.42,0:17:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.13,0:17:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洁西卡拉哈特在我家里面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aah! Jessica Lockhart! In my apartment!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的头号大影迷   我是你的头号大影迷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am such a huge fan. I am such a huge fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴能知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it's nice to know that--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:58.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica! Monica!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.81,0:18:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是我的室友瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That, uh-That's my roommate, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.44,0:18:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难怪你家里会有女人内衣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that explains all the women's underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.73,0:18:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  是真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.70,0:18:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能请你帮我一个忙吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I just ask you to do me-Aw. just one favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能打我一巴掌   朝脸上这里打吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you slap me? Would you slap me right here in the face?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.21,0:18:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很愿意  但我的律师说  我不能再那么做了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'd love to, but my lawyer said I can't do that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.38,0:18:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, here we go. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, wait. Just one moment. Um--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.80,0:18:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你个蠢贱人  我真的很抱歉  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're a stupid bitch. I really can't slap you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.06,0:18:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  你们太棒了  谢谢你们的拜访  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God, you're great. Thanks for stopping by. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.40,0:18:44.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am so sorry about that. Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.77,0:18:47.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我习惯被影迷包围  别担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Being adored, I'm used to it. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.94,0:18:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们给我寄了今天的剧本  他们从来没有寄剧本给我过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They sent me today's script. They never send me the script.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.95,0:18:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗   我一直都昏迷不醒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They don't? Well, no, I'm just in a coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:18:58.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这代表我有台词了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This must mean I have lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是怎么死的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How does it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.88,0:19:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你摔下马   然后撞到电篱笆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You get thrown from a horse into an electric fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.39,0:19:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  洁西卡讨厌马\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A what? Jessica hates horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.93,0:19:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经过这件事  她也不会喜欢电了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm guessing after this she's not gonna be crazy about electricity, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.69,0:19:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在妈妈的马鞍上动手脚  是个超级好点子  佛莱德克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Loosening the saddle on Mother's horse was brilliant, Fredrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.74,0:19:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,电篱笆那个点子太妙了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the electric fence, inspired.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.45,0:19:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信她真的死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe she's really gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.83,0:19:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你的四周   一切都是我们的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look around you. All of this is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.70,0:19:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不那么认为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.67,0:19:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.05,0:19:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  笛娜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the matter, Dina?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:53.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不认得你自己的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't you recognize your own...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.43,0:20:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡  大家都演得很好  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cut! That was great, everybody. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.31,0:20:03.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的是太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was so wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.85,0:20:07.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你比我更适合演洁西卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I think that you're a better Jessica than I ever was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  不  当然不是  但你真的很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. Of course not, but you were very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:14.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好消息  我找到新工作了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guess what? Good news. I got another job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.45,0:20:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  是什么样的工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great. Hey, all right! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.03,0:20:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要到瓜达拉哈拉拍电影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A film in Guadalajara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.33,0:20:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是指那个机场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The airport?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.96,0:20:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那是拉瓜迪亚机场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that's LaGuardia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要去墨西哥  哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is Mexico. Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.88,0:20:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会去多久\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, how long will you be gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.34,0:20:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,八个月\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Eight months.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太久了  没办法啊  但你可以来看我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a really long time. Yeah, but you could come and visit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.93,0:20:46.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我敢说你能在那里拥有几个地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I bet that you could, uh, own a few places down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.02,0:20:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的  或许我该先在纽约买房子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you know, I should probably buy a place in the city first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.19,0:20:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才刚反应过来你的意思  那\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I just got what you meant again. That is a--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那真的有难度  真的很难\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll tell you, that's a tricky one. It's a tricky one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.57,0:21:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.29,0:21:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.29,0:21:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请记住  我还在学吹风笛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem. Okay, now, uh, remember, I'm still learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.65,0:21:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一  二  三  四\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One, two, three, four!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.05,0:21:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们都知道这首歌  一起唱吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know the song. Sing along.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.78,0:22:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.69,0:22:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! No!
